30,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The walls are paper-thin; we hear everything. Also, people are eating at their desks, leaving a mess.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We've spent 68,000 yen on outside rentals for tiny groups. The fit-out quotes are 141,000 for a meeting room or 96,000 for a kitchen.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Rin,,Only two people use the room most of the time! And the fridge cleaning always falls on one person.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Servas,,"We have no place for private, difficult talks. The last one happened in front of everyone, which was quite sad.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Most of us spend twenty-five minutes just getting a hot lunch. Facilities callouts are low, so maintenance isn't the main issue.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, the meeting room is more expensive. If we can't have privacy due to the walls, is it worth it?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I suppose not... but we are paying for outside rooms anyway. It's a lot of money.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If it's just for two people, why make it a big meeting space? A kitchen sounds more fun!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Servas,,"A kitchen is lively, but it does not solve the need for a sanctuary or a place for honest words.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Toshio,,A kitchen would save us hours of walking every week. That is a tangible gain in productivity.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Shion,,A quiet room would solve the noise and the desk-crumbs issue. No one would eat there.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, do you think the time saved justifies the cost of the kitchen fit-out?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Rin,,Yes! And no more smelly bins at the desks!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Servas,,"If we choose a quiet room, we might finally have a place to speak without an audience.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The time loss is significant. However, the lack of privacy Servas mentioned is also a systemic failure.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Shion,,Logic suggests a Quiet Room. It stops the noise and the mess.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried about the budget, but the outside hire costs are the real drain.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Rin,,But a kitchen is so much better than just sitting in silence!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Servas,,We must decide if we need a place to bond or a place to hide.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"I lean toward the kitchen for the time efficiency, but the Quiet Room is the most low-maintenance.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
