55,3,1,talk,Shion,,I vote for the Quiet Room. It's the only way to ensure the office stays professional and quiet.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I think a Meeting Space would stop the outside hire costs, but the Quiet Room is cheaper. I'll go with Quiet Room.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Rin,,I really want the Open Kitchen! It's the best for everyone!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Servas,,"For the sake of our relationships and the need for privacy, I vote for the Quiet Room.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The time saved by a kitchen is tempting, but the Quiet Room is the most logical for the building's layout. Quiet Room.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Shion,,It seems we have a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I feel better knowing it's the most affordable option.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Rin,,"Aww, no snacks?","{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Servas,,"We can still share snacks, Rin, just not in the sanctuary.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
